# Marker so git keeps this directory. Maturin 1.15 needs a mixed-layout
# package dir for `module-name = "pl_transpiler._accel"`; without it the
# wheel wraps the cdylib as top-level `_accel`. This directory is a PEP 420
# namespace (no __init__.py) so the extra does not shadow the real
# `pl_transpiler` package. Excluded from the wheel.
